'''Choco Capsule''' (チョコサプネコカプセル, ''Chokosapu Kapuseru'', '''ChocoSurp Capsule''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy. It was added in [[Version 14.2 Update|Version 14.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Choco Capsule
|image = E 718.png
|first appearance = [[Boring if It's Only Tasty|Choco Capsule Advent]]
|money drop = 30¢ - 118¢
}}

==Enemy==
A pathetic enemy with extremely low health, damage and range. This enemy serves no threat to any player that comes across it.

==Strategy==
Use anything to defeat it as it will most likely die in one hit anyway.

==Encounters==
{{Collapsible}}
This enemy has always appeared at 100% strength magnification.
